===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-reverse sweep.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|cricket}} A [[batsman]]'s [[shot]] made by [[swinging]] the [[bat]] in a [[horizontal]] [[arc]] from [[leg]] to [[off]], normally whilst [[kneeling]].
# {{lb|en|sport}} The act of winning a [[match]] after losing the maximum number of [[set]]s where, should you lose one more set, you would instead lose the match. 

====Related terms====
